---
// Wide screens: the view tabs (Próximos, Calendario, Guardados) and the search field; under them (not in Guardados,
// which has no filters) one row of dropdown pills, [🕒 Cuándo ▾]
// (the list only) [Ritmo ▾] [Tipo ▾], and the toggle chip "Ocultar bares"; each pill opens its panel (Cuándo's menu, the
// rhythms under their families, the types). Under the pills, while filtering: "12 eventos", the choices as removable
// chips and "× Limpiar". Drawn by scripts/views/filters.ts, the panels opened by scripts/views/filterPanels.ts. Sticky
// (see toolbar.css). Phones don't show it: the bar pinned to the top has the chips (JumpBar.astro), the bar at the
// bottom the views, search, Guardados and Filtros (BottomNav.astro).
---

<div class="toolbar" role="region" aria-label="Vista y filtros">
  <div class="container toolbar__inner">
    <div class="tabs-row">
      <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Vista">
        <button class="tabs__tab" id="tab-upcoming" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="view-upcoming" data-view="upcoming">
          Próximos
        </button>
        <button class="tabs__tab" id="tab-calendar" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="view-calendar" data-view="calendar">
          Calendario
        </button>
        <button class="tabs__tab" id="tab-saved" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="view-saved" data-view="saved">
          Guardados <span class="tabs__count" data-saved-count hidden></span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="toolbar__tools">
        <input class="search-input toolbar__search" type="search" data-search placeholder="Buscar evento, academia, ritmo…"
          aria-label="Buscar eventos" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="filter-pills" id="filter-pills" role="group" aria-label="Filtros"></div>
    <div class="when-menu pill-panel pill-panel--menu" id="pill-panel-when" role="menu" aria-label="Cuándo" tabindex="-1" hidden></div>
    <div class="pill-panel" id="pill-panel-styles" role="dialog" aria-label="Ritmo" tabindex="-1" hidden></div>
    <div class="pill-panel" id="pill-panel-types" role="dialog" aria-label="Tipo de evento" tabindex="-1" hidden></div>
    <div class="filter-status" id="filter-status" role="group" aria-label="Filtros elegidos" hidden></div>
  </div>
</div>
